# PentVars demo build

A working front-end of the residence system. Open `index.html` (or push to GitHub Pages) and it runs with no server.

**Demo only.** Data lives in the browser's localStorage and demo passwords are plain text. Do not use real student data. The real system is the Next.js + PostgreSQL + Prisma build described in the README; `prisma/schema.prisma` is the database design for it, and `js/app.js` holds every business rule so it can be ported to API routes.

## Pages
| Page | Who | What |
|---|---|---|
| `index.html` | everyone | landing page |
| `login.html` | everyone | sign in, create student account |
| `apply.html` | students, SRC | details, GHS 2,000 fee banner, receipt, verification progress |
| `rooms.html` | students, SRC, hall reps | room grid per floor, take a room, request a switch |
| `dashboard.html` | students, SRC | application status, room, roommates, fees owed |
| `staff.html` | hall master/deputy, hall reps | verifications, switches, residents, incidents, fees, SRC registration |
| `management.html` | school management | action items first, then all halls |

