3. Sign in as Ama again: room selection is unlocked.

## Rules implemented (from the README)
Fee verification by Hall Master/Deputy (interchangeable) plus Hall President and Deputy; SRC path with waived fee approved by the SRC rep; gender-restricted floors and halls; Anan 4th floor closed; executive rooms only for SRC/reps, capped at 3; soft "don't room with" note; switch requests decided by hall reps with no re-verification; incident billing to one student or split evenly; management sees every hall and an escalation queue.

## Assumptions to confirm (not in the README)
- Regular room capacity is **4** (`REG_CAP` in `js/app.js`).
- Executive rooms are numbers 1, 2, 16, 17 on each non-ground floor (`EXEC_NUMS`).
- Sappho and Yeboah also have 30 rooms per floor.
- Anan's gender per floor is fixed as listed in the README.
- Hall Master, Deputy and reps each get a seeded account per hall.
